  "_about": "a bat SCULPTED on its parts (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/carn/gen/bat.py): a big-eared microbat, 15 cm head-body, 55 cm across the wings -- a furry barrel paler before, a short pug face, small eyes, big ears; each wing as a bat's is made (mammals.js batWing): the arm to the wrist, three long fingers fanned from the hand, the skin stretched between them and back to the flank and the hind legs, spread as it flies and beating on the flier's clock (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): big tall cupped sheets (sharp.js `fin`), broad below, round-tipped, the hollow ribbed across (the `ridges` pattern laid in the ear's own frame); the roots faired.",
